# Manifold level 8
# The armory (stage 5g), the shooter's weapons: the six on their racks where you come in (a dart, a
# bolt, a stick, grenades, a shotgun, a launcher), training dummies down the range at 2, 5, 10 and 20 m,
# and two blocks to reach with an explosion jump: 3 m high (a rocket at your feet) and 6 m (a rocket
# and a jump at once). Best in first person: `view.camera first`.
title The armory
spawn 0 1 11
facing 0 0 -1

box 0 -0.5 -2    14 0.5 16   color #6f6a62  name floor
box -14.2 2 -2   0.2 2 16    color #5a544c
box 14.2 2 -2    0.2 2 16    color #5a544c
box 0 2 14.2     14.4 2 0.2  color #5a544c
box 0 2 -18.2    14.4 2 0.2  color #5a544c

# The racks, in a row where you come in: kinds 1 to 6.
sensor weapon  -5 0.5 8.5   0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 1  name dart_rack
sensor weapon  -3 0.5 8.5   0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 2  name bolt_rack
sensor weapon  -1 0.5 8.5   0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 3  name stick_rack
sensor weapon  1 0.5 8.5    0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 4  name grenade_rack
sensor weapon  3 0.5 8.5    0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 5  name shotgun_rack
sensor weapon  5 0.5 8.5    0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 6  name launcher_rack

# The range: dummies looking back at you, 2, 5, 10 and 20 m from the racks' line.
sensor dummy  0 1 6.5    0.3 0.8 0.3  rotate y 180
sensor dummy  -2 1 3.5   0.3 0.8 0.3  rotate y 180
sensor dummy  2 1 -1.5   0.3 0.8 0.3  rotate y 180
sensor dummy  0 1 -11.5  0.3 0.8 0.3  rotate y 180

# For the explosion jump: a block 3 m high, and one 6 m high behind it.
box 10 1.5 2     2 1.5 2     color #7a6a52  name block_3
box 10 3 -6      2 3 2       color #7a6a52  name block_6

sensor checkpoint  0 1 11   1 1 1
